      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ASTON BUGSY (2) delivered an eye catching 28.67 to claim a Grade 4/5 over 510m at Sale last start. In winning form and can measure up again. RITZA OLD MATE (1) is an honest type who is having his first try here. Jumped well from box one latest to win by 0.8 lengths at Geelong (26.01) and has drawn the same this time. Winner at his latest appearance in the quickest time on the card. Sure to measure up. LAMIA NONNA MIM (7) was out of the placings last time when sixth at this track (30.54) but scored three back at Sandown (29.59). Solid record here at the distance winning three races. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Better than last start and can bounce back. SCOTT GNARLY (8) has ability and can feature with the right run after missing a cheque here most recently.",
